TWO TRIBES. 

WITH TURKISH AGGRESSORS THREATENING THE SOVEREIGNTY OF SYRIA, THE 
SYRIAN GOVERNMENT HAS HAD NO CHOICE BUT TO INITIATE PREEMPTIVE 
MEASURES: A POLICE ACTION ALONG THE SYRIAN/TURKISH BORDER. 

UNITS OF THE 9TH ARMORED GUARDS HAVE BEEN DEPLOYED TO THE REGION. 
THE OVERALL OBJECTIVE WILL BE THE NEUTRALIZATION OF THE MLF FORCES
THE TURKS HAVE CALLED TO THEIR AID IN THEIR QUEST TO THREATEN
SYRIAN INTEGRITY.

1ST AND 2ND TROOPS OF THE 9TH GUARDS HAVE BEEN ISSUED ORDERS TO 
ENGAGE ENEMY TARGETS WITHIN THE ZONE DESIGNATED BRAVO SECTOR. 

1ST TROOP MUST PROCEED ON A COURSE HEADING OF 125ø S/SE. UNIT 
OBJECTIVE WILL BE A MLF FORWARD COMMUNICATIONS RELAY POST.

2ND TROOP HAS A COURSE HEADING OF 160ø S/SE. DESIGNATED OBJECTIVE
IS A MLF FUEL REPLENISHMENT EMPLACEMENT. SECONDARY TARGET WILL 
INCLUDE GROUND BASED ARTILLERY BATTERY.
